The '''Mytaranor sector''' was a [[sector]] of the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]] which contained the [[Kashyyyk system]].<ref name="USW" /> During the [[Clone Wars]], the [[Battle of Kashyyyk]] occurred on the [[planet]] [[Kashyyyk]] in the Kashyyyk<ref name="Episode III" /> [[Star system|system]]. The system also contained the planet [[Trandosha]] and its [[moon]] [[Wasskah]],<ref name="USW" /> where a [[Battle on Wasskah|skirmish]] also took place during the Clone Wars.<ref name="PL" /> It neighbored the [[Messert system]].<ref name="Encyclopedia">''[[Star Wars: Character Encyclopedia, Updated and Expanded Edition]]''</ref> The [[Slavery|slave]] trade occurred in the sector, where [[Gigoran]]s were frequently sold as [[Wookiee]]s.<ref name="Dawn">''[[Dawn of Rebellion]]''</ref>

